  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1709702450_5669_cf069ffd7eadf85b3727140b06a58a9e.jpg",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Brand introduction:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Instead of being driven by passion, we were driven by the customer - creating products customers love leads to win win situations. Due to this every last millimeter of our products are designed with careful consideration to what the customers wants.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>Product description:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Travel Pad is a laptop accessories pouch with integrated mousepad. It enables users to easily carry and use a mouse. Now they'll always have the perfect surface to work on no matter where they are. Toppping this off, the rectangular design fits perfectly in backpacks and is easy to take out. This means no more digging out accessories from the bottom of your bag.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Microweave surface for pinpoint mouse accuracy.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Neoprene base prevents skidding.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Pouch fits most mouses.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">No more scraping noises that arise from using a mouse on a desk.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Always have a protective work surface for your trusty mouse.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>",
